sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: standby.<br>Calling outside standby asserts on the Node.<br>Starts advertising and transitions to advertising state.<br>Pre-conditions: optional SetAdvertisementData / SetScanResponseData /<br>SetSecurityPreferences / SetAllowPairing before Advertise.
    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.Advertise(type=advInd, advertisingInterval=160)
    Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(advertising)
